0..69 Comment "// A first-order model of `theory Nat` written in gandr source. For a"
70..146 Comment "// first-order signature, Kaposi and Xie\'s first-order models (_Second-Order"
147..193 Comment "// Generalised Algebraic Theories_, FSCD 2024,"
194..270 Comment "// doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.FSCD.2024.10) are its algebras: a carrier for the sort"
271..346 Comment "// and a function per operation. Written in source, the models of `Nat` are"
347..425 Comment "// the record type `#{nat : Type, zero : () => nat, succ : (n : nat) => nat}`,"
426..502 Comment "// one field per component of `Model(Nat)` in the order the derivation mints"
503..581 Comment "// them, and the syntax model, a counting model and a `Model(Nat)` module each"
582..596 Comment "// inhabit it."
597..599 Comment "//"
600..614 Comment "// - see: #640"
616..657 Comment "// The naturals\' signature, `theory Nat`."
